=F0=9F=94=8D HIDDEN NICHE OPPORTUNITY: Professional Organizers

Nobody's built software for professional organizers. So they assembled =
their own stack: Google Forms for intake. Bonsai for contracts it can't =
handle. Before/after photos in a camera roll linked to no client. Nine =
tools. Zero integration.

Intake breaks first. Organizers email forms by =
hand because their contract tools can't handle residential access waivers =
or room-by-room scope agreements. One client, three documents, none of them=
 connected.

Opportunity: An intake-first platform for organizing =
businesses. Pre-built templates for residential access waivers and scope =
agreements. Digital signing. Auto-fill from client profiles. They're paying=
 for nine tools because nobody gave them one.

